---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { site } from '../site';

const mail = `mailto:${site.email}`;
---

<Prose
  title="Terms of use | Kuriova"
  heading="Terms"
  description="The terms for using kuriova.com and Kuriova's videos, written in plain English."
>
  <p>
    These terms cover kuriova.com and the videos, images and text Kuriova publishes. By using the site you accept them.
    Questions go to <a href={mail}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Kuriova’s videos, graphics, scripts and the K mark belong to Kuriova or to the people who license them to us.</li>
    <li>
      You are welcome to share links to our pages and videos, and to embed our videos using the tools YouTube and other
      platforms provide.
    </li>
    <li>
      Please don’t download, re-upload, edit or sell our videos or graphics without written permission. To license
      footage or graphics, email <a href={mail}>{site.email}</a>.
    </li>
    <li>The Kuriova name and K mark may not be used in a way that suggests we endorse you or your product.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we make our videos</h2>
  <p>
    AI tools and agents help us research and produce our videos. Every factual claim is checked against primary
    sources and every video is reviewed by people before it is published. Our videos are made to inform and entertain;
    they are not professional, medical, legal or financial advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>
    If you find an error, tell us at <a href={mail}>{site.email}</a> with a source if you can. We review every report and
    correct the description, pinned comment or video when we were wrong.
  </p>

  <h2>Other platforms and links</h2>
  <p>
    Our videos live on YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook and X, and those platforms’ own terms apply when you use
    them. Links to other websites are provided for convenience; we are not responsible for their content.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to keep the site accurate and available, but it is provided as it is, without warranties of any kind.
    To the extent the law allows, Kuriova is not liable for losses that arise from using the site or relying on its
    content. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under consumer law that cannot be excluded.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If these terms change, we update this page and the date at the top.</p>
</Prose>
